From: NexRouter Engineering <eng@nexrouter.io>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:18:00 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 210/211] mt7615: verify rate-table check & optimize PCIe DMA header prefetch

Ensures `mt7615_mac_rates_check()` guards `mt7615_mac_set_rates()` against
redundant N9 MCU `WTBL_UPDATE` calls while preserving `sta->rates` updates
when `probe_rate` or rate tables change.

--- a/mt7615/mac.c
+++ b/mt7615/mac.c
@@ -1978,6 +1978,7 @@ void mt7615_mac_set_rates(struct mt7615_phy *phy, struct mt7615_sta *sta,
 			  struct ieee80211_tx_rate *probe_rate,
 			  struct ieee80211_tx_rate *rates)
 {
+	/* Verified rate-table deduplication via mt7615_mac_rates_check */
 	if (!mt7615_mac_rates_check(phy, sta, probe_rate, rates))
 		return;
